Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.92,0:22:32.51,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}身處最糟的境遇中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:37.85,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}絲毫沒有新意的計劃 瘋狂的快感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.98,0:22:42.22,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}入侵我的大腦 強行脫離掌控
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.11,0:22:51.45,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}真是抱歉 我要拋下你們先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.54,0:22:55.33,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}我獨自 獨自升級 將超越極限吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:59.09,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\c&H1E1013&\1a&H00&\3c&HE6E6E6&\3a&H00&\bord0.5}告別我的弱點 就此凌駕於屬於自己的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:02.04,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\c&H1E1013&\1a&H00&\3c&HE6E6E6&\3a&H00&\bord0.5}任何人都望塵莫及 進行無限的革命狩獵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:05.89,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}任何人都望塵莫及 進行無限的革命狩獵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.89,0:23:13.30,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}迎接屬於我的勇敢 在崛起後便爆發
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.43,0:23:16.92,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}就讓我獻上S級的營救吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:20.41,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}若是能守護你的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:26.98,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}最弱傑作降臨
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.44,0:23:30.24,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}「最強的我」即為我的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:40.96,song,,0,0,0,,The time has come to pack away all the joys
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.15,0:14:40.96,song,,0,0,0,,時光將所有的喜悅裹挾帶走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:47.67,song,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna hear my apology
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:47.67,song,,0,0,0,,你不會想聽到我的道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.07,song,,0,0,0,,Get it off my chest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.07,song,,0,0,0,,全部說出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:50.67,song,,0,0,0,,I would do my best
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:50.67,song,,0,0,0,,我會盡力做到最好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.17,song,,0,0,0,,I know what you fear
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.17,song,,0,0,0,,我知道你在害怕什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:56.38,song,,0,0,0,,Similarities we possess
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:56.38,song,,0,0,0,,我們的相似之處
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.44,song,,0,0,0,,Never will I pass the test
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:14:59.44,song,,0,0,0,,我永遠都不會通過測試
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:02.32,song,,0,0,0,,The scene is fading
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:02.32,song,,0,0,0,,那一幕幕漸漸褪色
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:05.63,song,,0,0,0,,Can my soul be put to rest
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:05.63,song,,0,0,0,,我的靈魂會得到安息嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:10.49,song,,0,0,0,,Death is gonna come for me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:10.49,song,,0,0,0,,死亡會降臨我身
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:13.07,song,,0,0,0,,Be the change I couldn't be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:13.07,song,,0,0,0,,成就我無法實現的改變
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:17.31,song,,0,0,0,,Can you find a life that's like fairytales
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:17.31,song,,0,0,0,,你能找到一種童話式的生活嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:19.53,song,,0,0,0,,Far from this tragedy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:19.53,song,,0,0,0,,與這樣的悲劇毫不相干
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.92,song,,0,0,0,,Sad you had to wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.53,0:15:21.92,song,,0,0,0,,很遺憾 你要等待我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.63,song,,0,0,0,,Feels like an eternity
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:24.63,song,,0,0,0,,一場永恆的等待
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.69,song,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for my sins
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.69,song,,0,0,0,,請原諒我的罪過
